      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Wilds only prevents the Explore action - it would have no effect on placing a Town due to an Event or Build, I&#39;m afraid. The land with Wilds is just as valid a location as any other for your Town placement. Unless you meant Disease...in which case as far as I&#39;m aware that still only blocks the Build action, so I think it would only get to prevent Town placement if the Event specifies &quot;Invaders Build in X land&quot;, not just &quot;add a Town to X land&quot; or similar.</p>",
