      "created_at": "2018-07-28T15:43:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The event is called \"Promising Farmland\", if you want to look it up on SICK.</p><p>To add to what grysqrl said, if both lands on a board had Wilds (or were otherwise prevented from Exploring), then you would not place either a Town or Explorer.</p>",
